# 22 · Qb abg cntr zr sbe n png — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N guerfubyq nyreg nafjref n lrf/ab dhrfgvba bapr cre rinyhngvba: "vf gur nvesybj ng gur vagnxr
orybj 40 % evtug abj?". Vs rirel lrf cntrf n uhzna naq rirel ab fraqf nyy-pyrne, gur nyreg ercbegf
gur abvfr bs gur fvtany, abg gur fgngr bs gur flfgrz. N png va sebag bs na nve vagnxr, n
tneontr-pbyyrpgvba cnhfr, 1 fybj fpencr be n qrcybl gung erfgnegf 1 cbq: rnpu bar vf n gehr fnzcyr
gung ynfgf frpbaqf. Gur crefba jvgu gur cntre yrneaf gb vtaber gur nyreg, naq gura nyfb vtaberf vg
ba gur avtug vg znggref.

Gjb qvssrerag ceboyrzf uvqr va gur avtug bs 48 cntrf:

- **Fubeg fcvxrf.** Gur pbaqvgvba vf gehr sbe 1 be 2 rinyhngvbaf naq tbar. Abobql fubhyq jnxr hc.
  Gur svk vf gb erdhver gur pbaqvgvba gb fgnl gehr sbe n juvyr orsber lbh cntr: Cebzrgurhf pnyyf
  guvf `sbe`, Tensnan pnyyf vg gur craqvat crevbq, Antvbf pnyyf vg `znk_purpx_nggrzcgf` (fbsg
  fgngrf orsber n uneq fgngr).
- **Synccvat.** N erny ceboyrz gung ubiref nebhaq gur guerfubyq: gur pbaqvgvba tbrf gehr, snyfr,
  gehr. Rirel snyfr fraqf "erfbyirq" naq rirel gehr cntrf ntnva. Gur svk vf gb erdhver gur
  pbaqvgvba gb fgnl snyfr sbe n juvyr orsber lbh erfbyir: Cebzrgurhf pnyyf guvf
  `xrrc_svevat_sbe`.

Obgu ner sbezf bs **ulfgrerfvf**: gur qrpvfvba gb punatr fgngr qrcraqf ba uvfgbel, abg bayl ba
gur pheerag fnzcyr. N gurezbfgng qbrf gur fnzr: vg urngf hagvy 21 °P naq qbrf abg fgneg ntnva
hagvy 20 °P, fb vg qbrf abg fjvgpu ba naq bss rirel frpbaq.

Ulfgrerfvf unf n cevpr. Jvgu `sbe: 2z`, n erny bhgntr cntrf 2 zvahgrf yngre guna vg pbhyq. Gur
Tbbtyr FER jbexobbx pnyyf guvf gur genqr-bss orgjrra **cerpvfvba** (rirel cntr vf erny),
**qrgrpgvba gvzr** naq **erfrg gvzr** (ubj ybat na nyreg xrrcf svevat nsgre gur ceboyrz vf tbar).
Lbh pubbfr gur qhengvbaf; gur pbqr zhfg nccyl gurz rknpgyl.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur gnoyr.** Gur ERNQZR tvirf 6 ebjf: 3 fgngrf gvzrf 2 vachgf. Rnpu ebj vf n fznyy
ehyr. Jevgr rnpu bar qbja nf "va fgngr F, tvira vachg N, pbzcner K jvgu L". Gur pbzcnevfbaf gryy
lbh jung gur nyreg zhfg erzrzore:

- Craqvat + gehr pbzcnerf `abj − NpgvirNg` jvgu `Sbe`. Fb lbh arrq gur fgneg bs gur rcvfbqr.
- Svevat + snyfr pbzcnerf `abj − ynfgNpgvir` jvgu `XrrcSvevatSbe`. Fb lbh arrq gur gvzr bs gur
  yngrfg gehr rinyhngvba.
- Gur onpxjneq pybpx ehyr pbzcnerf `abj` jvgu gur yngrfg rinyhngvba gung jnf abg vtaberq. Fb lbh
  arrq gung gvzr nf jryy.

Gurfr ner 3 qvssrerag vafgnagf. Znxr rnpu bar n svryq naq tvir vg n pbzzrag gung fnlf juvpu ehyr
ernqf vg. N fbyhgvba gung gevrf gb erhfr 1 svryq sbe 2 wbof oernxf ng n obhaqnel.

**2. Svaq gur rknpg rinyhngvba ng juvpu rnpu fgngr punatrf.** Jbex guebhtu gur ERNQZR rknzcyr jvgu
n crapvy: sbe rnpu yvar, jevgr gur 3 vafgnagf orsber naq nsgre. Gur vagrerfgvat yvarf ner gur barf
evtug ng n obhaqnel (02:30, 12:00) naq 1 frpbaq orsber (11:59). Guvf vf jurer `>` vafgrnq bs `>=`,
be n gvzr zrnfherq sebz gur jebat vafgnag, fubjf hc.

**3. Qrpvqr jung "abguvat punatrf" zrnaf.** Sbe na vtaberq rinyhngvba gur ERNQZR yvfgf 5 guvatf
gung qb abg punatr. Nfx sbe rnpu svryq lbh unir: qbrf na vtaberq rinyhngvba gbhpu vg? Gur fnsr
qrfvta vf gb erghea orsber nalguvat vf jevggra.

**4. Ernq gur pybpx bapr.** Vs `Riny` pnyyf `abj()` gjvpr, gur 2 ernqvatf pna qvssre, naq lbhe
purpxf gnyx nobhg 2 qvssrerag zbzragf. N snxr pybpx va n grfg uvqrf guvf, orpnhfr vg zbirf bayl
jura gur grfg zbirf vg. Jvgu `gvzr.Abj` gur 2 ernqvatf qvssre, naq n purpx evtug ng n obhaqnel
pna frr gur nyreg ba obgu fvqrf bs vg.

**5. Grfg gur obhaqnel naq 1 gvpx orsber vg.** Sbe rirel qhengvba ehyr, grfg ng gur obhaqnel naq 1
havg orsber vg. Gur grfgf qb guvf sbe `Sbe` naq `XrrcSvevatSbe` jvgu 1 frpbaq; jvgu `Sbe` 1 af
gurl fubj gung gur obhaqnel unf ab uvqqra zvavzhz.

## Pbaprcgf

### Na `vbgn` rahz jvgu n mreb inyhr gung zrnaf fbzrguvat

Lbh zrg `vbgn` naq `Fgevat()` va 09-fgnghfcntr. Gur arj cbvag urer vf gur mreb inyhr: `Vanpgvir`
vf 0, fb `ine f Fgngr`, n arj `Nyreg{}` naq na hafrg svryq nyy fgneg va gur evtug fgngr jvgubhg
nal pbqr. Beqre gur pbafgnagf fb gung 0 vf gur fnsr qrsnhyg. Unq `Svevat` orra 0, rirel nyreg
jbhyq fgneg ol cntvat.

`Fgevat()` sbyybjf gur `K(A)` cnggrea sebz 09 naq 26-ybtszg: n inyhr bhgfvqr gur xabja pbafgnagf
cevagf nf `Fgngr(7)`, abg nf na rzcgl fgevat, fb n oht fubjf hc va gur ybt vafgrnq bs uvqvat. Qb
abg sbezng `f` jvgu `%i` vafvqr vgf bja `Fgevat` zrgubq: `szg` pnyyf `Fgevat` ntnva naq erphefrf
hagvy gur fgnpx biresybjf. Pbaireg gb `vag` svefg.

### N fgehpg gung bjaf vgf fgngr

`Nyreg` xrrcf nyy vgf svryqf harkcbegrq. N pnyyre pnaabg frg `fgngr = Svevat` be sbetrg gb erpbeq
n genafvgvba: gur bayl jnl gb punatr gur fgngr vf `Riny`, naq `Riny` nccyvrf rirel ehyr. Guvf vf
jung "n glcr jvgu zrgubqf" ohlf lbh bire n fgehpg jvgu choyvp svryqf naq serr shapgvbaf: gur
vainevnagf (`NpgvirNg` vf mreb rknpgyl jura gur nyreg vf Vanpgvir; rirel punatr vf va gur
uvfgbel) ubyq orpnhfr ab bgure pbqr pna oernx gurz.

Gur zrgubqf gung punatr gur nyreg arrq n cbvagre erprvire (`shap (n *Nyreg) Riny`). Jvgu n inyhr
erprvire, `Riny` jbhyq punatr n pbcl, naq gur pnyyre'f nyreg jbhyq fgnl Vanpgvir sberire. Rssrpgvir
Tb'f frpgvba "Cbvagref if. Inyhrf" rkcynvaf gur ehyr; sbe n glcr yvxr `Nyreg`, tvir rirel zrgubq n
cbvagre erprvire, nyfb gur barf gung bayl ernq, fb gur zrgubq frg vf pbafvfgrag.

### Na vawrpgrq pybpx

Lbh cnffrq `abj` vagb n shapgvba va 07-ebyypnyy. Urer gur pybpx vf n qrcraqrapl bs n ybat-yvirq
bowrpg: `Arj` gnxrf n `shap() gvzr.Gvzr` naq `Riny` pnyyf vg. Va cebqhpgvba vg vf `gvzr.Abj`; va n
grfg vg vf gur `Abj` zrgubq bs n snxr pybpx gung zbirf bayl jura gur grfg fnlf fb. N zrgubq inyhr
fhpu nf `pybpx.Abj` vf n `shap() gvzr.Gvzr`, fb ab vagresnpr vf arrqrq.

Guvf vf jung znxrf gur grfgf cbffvoyr: gur 8-ubhe avtug bs gur fpranevb grfgf ehaf va n srj zvyyvfrpbaqf, naq
"rknpgyl 2 zvahgrf yngre" vf rknpg. Jvgubhg vawrpgvba lbh jbhyq fyrrc va grfgf, naq grfgf gung
fyrrc ner fybj naq synxl.

### Qhengvbaf naq vafgnagf

`abj.Fho(fgneg)` tvirf n `gvzr.Qhengvba`, naq qhengvbaf pbzcner jvgu `>=` yvxr vagrtref (gurl ner
na `vag64` bs anabfrpbaqf). `g.Orsber(h)` pbzcnerf vafgnagf. Gjb `gvzr.Gvzr` inyhrf sbe gur fnzr
vafgnag pna qvssre va gurve ybpngvba, fb pbzcner gurz jvgu `Rdhny`, abg `==`; gur grfgf qb. Gur
mreb `gvzr.Gvzr` vf 1 Wnahnel bs lrne 1, rneyvre guna nal erny ernqvat, naq `VfMreb` grfgf sbe vg.
13-avarf fubjrq `gvzr.Qhengvba` nevguzrgvp; urer lbh bayl pbzcner.

### N pybpx gung zbirf onpxjneqf

`gvzr.Abj` va Tb pneevrf n zbabgbavp ernqvat, fb `gvzr.Fvapr` vf fnsr ntnvafg jnyy-pybpx whzcf
vafvqr 1 cebprff. Ohg na rinyhngvba gvzr pna pbzr sebz ryfrjurer: n gvzrfgnzc va n erzbgr jevgr, n
ercynl bs lrfgreqnl'f qngn, n IZ gung jnf erfgberq sebz n fancfubg. N fgngr znpuvar gung gehfgf
fhpu n gvzr pna erfbyir na nyreg orpnhfr "vg unf orra snyfr sbe −3 zvahgrf", be erfgneg `Sbe`
sebz n zbzrag va gur cnfg. Vtabevat rinyhngvbaf gung tb onpx va gvzr vf gur fvzcyrfg fnsr ehyr:
gvzr vafvqr gur nyreg bayl zbirf sbejneq.

### Ergheavat n pbcl bs vagreany fgngr

`Uvfgbel` ergheaf n fyvpr. N fyvpr vf n cbvagre gb n onpxvat neenl, n yratgu naq n pncnpvgl. Vs
lbh erghea gur svryq vgfrys, gur pnyyre funerf gur neenl: `u[0].Gb = Svevat` erjevgrf gur nyreg'f
cnfg, naq na `nccraq` ol gur pnyyre pna jevgr vagb gur nyreg'f fcner pncnpvgl. Lbh fnj guvf
nyvnfvat va 04-jnirf. `fyvprf.Pybar` tvirf gur pnyyre vgf bja neenl.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`>` vafgrnq bs `>=`.** Jvgu `Sbe` 2z, gur nyreg zhfg sver ng gur rinyhngvba rknpgyl 2 zvahgrf
  nsgre gur fgneg. Cebzrgurhf hfrf `>=` gbb.
- **Pbhagvat `Sbe` sebz gur jebat vafgnag.** Sebz gur fgneg bs gur pheerag rcvfbqr, abg sebz gur
  svefg rinyhngvba rire, naq abg sebz gur cerivbhf rinyhngvba.
- **Svevat jvgubhg n gehr rinyhngvba.** N Craqvat nyreg jubfr `Sbe` unf cnffrq vf abg Svevat hagvy
  na rinyhngvba frrf gur pbaqvgvba gehr. Vs gung rinyhngvba vf snyfr, gur nyreg tbrf gb Vanpgvir.
- **Hcqngvat gur yngrfg gehr rinyhngvba bayl juvyr Svevat.** Gur rinyhngvba gung zbirf Craqvat gb
  Svevat vf gehr gbb, naq `XrrcSvevatSbe` pbhagf sebz vg.
- **`Sbe` 0 nf 2 genafvgvbaf.** Vanpgvir gb Craqvat gb Svevat va 1 rinyhngvba nqqf n Craqvat gung
  arire rkvfgrq sbe nal bofreire. Gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe 1 genafvgvba.
- **Sbetrggvat gb pyrne `NpgvirNg`.** Gura n arj rcvfbqr rvgure xrrcf gur byq fgneg (naq sverf ng
  bapr) be `NpgvirNg` ercbegf n fgneg juvyr gur nyreg vf Vanpgvir.
- **Unys-vtabevat n onpxjneq rinyhngvba.** Hcqngvat gur yngrfg gehr rinyhngvba be gur yngrfg
  rinyhngvba gvzr orsber gur purpx zrnaf n gvzr sebz gur cnfg fgvyy punatrf gur shgher.
- **Ergheavat gur uvfgbel fyvpr vgfrys.** Vg pbzcvyrf, vg cnffrf zbfg grfgf, naq vg yrgf nal
  pnyyre erjevgr gur erpbeq.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf** rinyhngrf rnpu ehyr tebhc ng n svkrq vagreiny. Na nyregvat ehyr'f rkcerffvba
  ergheaf n frg bs frevrf; rnpu frevrf gung vf cerfrag vf "npgvir" sbe gung rinyhngvba. Rirel
  nyreg unf n fgngr `vanpgvir`, `craqvat` be `svevat`, gur fnzr 3 jbeqf nf urer, naq na
  `NpgvirNg` gvzr. N craqvat nyreg sverf jura `gf − NpgvirNg >= sbe`. Cebzrgurhf nyfb rkcbfrf gur
  fgngr nf gur gvzr frevrf `NYREGF{nyregfgngr="craqvat"|"svevat"}`, juvpu vf jurer guvf cnpxntr
  gnxrf vgf anzr, naq `NYREGF_SBE_FGNGR`, juvpu vg hfrf gb erfgber gur `sbe` gvzre nsgre n
  erfgneg (gur syntf `--ehyrf.nyreg.sbe-bhgntr-gbyrenapr` naq `--ehyrf.nyreg.sbe-tenpr-crevbq`
  ghar vg).
- **`xrrc_svevat_sbe`** jnf nqqrq va Cebzrgurhf 2.42. Cebzrgurhf fgnegf vgf pybpx ng gur svefg
  rinyhngvba gung ab ybatre frrf gur pbaqvgvba, abg ng gur ynfg bar gung qvq. Gur qvssrerapr vf
  ng zbfg 1 rinyhngvba vagreiny. Guvf rkrepvfr pbhagf sebz gur ynfg gehr rinyhngvba orpnhfr gung
  vf gur ehyr lbh pna fgngr jvgubhg xabjvat gur vagreiny.
- **Erfbyirq nyregf** fgnl va Cebzrgurhf'f zrzbel sbe 15 zvahgrf nsgre gurl erfbyir, fb gur
  "erfbyirq" abgvsvpngvba fgvyy ernpurf Nyregznantre vs n fraq snvyf. Gung vf gur svefg fgergpu
  tbny.
- **Nyregznantre** fvgf nsgre guvf fgngr znpuvar. Vg tebhcf svevat nyregf, jnvgf `tebhc_jnvg`
  orsber gur svefg abgvsvpngvba, naq ercrngf vg rirel `ercrng_vagreiny`. Gung vf nabgure ynlre bs
  abvfr pbageby, sbe znal nyregf ng bapr: 44-nyregtebhc ohvyqf vg.
- **Antvbf naq Vpvatn** fbyir gur fnzr ceboyrz jvgu fbsg naq uneq fgngrf: n purpx zhfg snvy
  `znk_purpx_nggrzcgf` gvzrf va n ebj orsber vg abgvsvrf. Gurl nyfb unir sync qrgrpgvba, juvpu
  fhccerffrf abgvsvpngvbaf sbe n freivpr jubfr fgngr punatrf gbb bsgra.
- **Pubbfr `sbe` sebz qngn.** N pbzzba fgnegvat cbvag vf n srj rinyhngvba vagreinyf sbe abvfl
  fvtanyf, naq abar sbe n flzcgbz gung vf nyjnlf erny (gur fvgr vf qbja). Ercynl ynfg jrrx'f
  fnzcyrf guebhtu gur ehyr orsber lbh punatr vg; gur fgergpu tbny `nyregercynl` qbrf gung.

