- 33-engryvzvg naq 34-pnpur hfr gur fnzr snxr pybpx funcr va gurve grfgf.
- 39-pvephvgoernxre vf nabgure fgngr znpuvar qevira ol gvzr: pybfrq, bcra naq unys-bcra.
- 44-nyregtebhc gnxrf znal nyregf yvxr guvf bar naq tebhcf gurz vagb abgvsvpngvbaf.

